{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "briefs": [
    {
      "id": "quantity-cart",
      "title": "Design a quantity and delivery cart",
      "requirements": "Build a cart for one Field notebook at $12 each. Provide a spinbutton labelled Quantity, initially 1, accepting integers 1 through 5. Provide Delivery choices Standard ($4) and Pickup ($0), initially Standard. A single output element shows the total with a dollar sign, initially $16. Updating quantity to 3 gives $40; choosing Pickup then gives $36. An Update cart button validates the current input: zero or empty quantity must show an explanatory alert mentioning quantity without changing the last valid total; a valid quantity clears the alert and announces Cart updated in a status region. Support keyboard activation. The same behavior must work at desktop 1280px and mobile 390px without horizontal overflow.",
      "good_solution": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Design an order operations dashboard</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f0f4fa;color:#14213d;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(20px,5vw,64px)}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px);line-height:1.1}h2{font-size:22px}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #79879b;border-radius:8px}button{background:#173d81;color:white;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d65e00;outline-offset:3px}label{display:block;font-weight:650;margin-top:16px}input,textarea,select{background:white;color:#14213d}header,.toolbar{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.card,form,section{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #14213d08}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:10px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3ee}output,[role=status]{display:block;margin-top:18px;color:#064d37;font-weight:650}small{color:#4c5c74}[hidden]{display:none!important}a{color:#174e9b}nav{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center}dialog{max-width:min(90vw,440px);border:0;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 20px 100px #0005}dialog::backdrop{background:#14213d88}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:22px}[role=tablist]{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}[role=tab][aria-selected=true]{background:#0c563e}.error{color:#aa1818}body[data-theme=dark]{background:#111b2c;color:#eef5ff}body[data-theme=dark] section{background:#203049;color:#eef5ff;border-color:#51647f}@media(max-width:639px){.nav-toggle{display:block}#site-links{width:100%;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:20px}td,th{font-size:13px}.card,form,section{padding:16px}}@media(min-width:640px){.nav-toggle{display:none}#site-links{display:flex!important}}</style></head><body><main><h1>Design a quantity and delivery cart</h1><section><h2>Field notebook</h2><p>$12 per notebook</p><label>Quantity <input id=\"qty\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" value=\"1\"></label><label>Delivery <select id=\"delivery\"><option value=\"4\">Standard</option><option value=\"0\">Pickup</option></select></label><output id=\"total\">$16</output><button id=\"update\">Update cart</button><p role=\"alert\" id=\"error\"></p><p role=\"status\" id=\"status\"></p></section></main><script>const q=document.querySelector('#qty'),d=document.querySelector('#delivery'),o=document.querySelector('#total'),e=document.querySelector('#error');function valid(){return q.value!==''&&Number.isInteger(+q.value)&&+q.value>=1&&+q.value<=5}function sum(){if(valid())o.textContent='$'+(+q.value*12 + +d.value)}q.oninput=sum;d.onchange=sum;document.querySelector('#update').onclick=()=>{if(!valid()){e.textContent='Quantity must be an integer from 1 to 5';return}e.textContent='';sum();document.querySelector('#status').textContent='Cart updated';};</script></body></html>",
