    {
      "id": "shipping-accordion",
      "title": "Design a shipping help accordion",
      "requirements": "Build a help page with three buttons: Shipping, Returns, Warranty. Each controls a uniquely identified answer region using aria-controls and reports aria-expanded. Initially all answers are hidden and all buttons report false. Activating Shipping reveals the text Orders ship in two days. Activating Returns reveals Returns accepted within 30 days and closes Shipping; only one answer can be open. Activating Returns again closes it. Warranty reveals Coverage lasts one year. Buttons support native Enter and Space keyboard activation and keep focus on the activated button. These behaviors apply at desktop 1280px and mobile 390px; avoid horizontal overflow.",
      "good_solution": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Design an order operations dashboard</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f0f4fa;color:#14213d;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(20px,5vw,64px)}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px);line-height:1.1}h2{font-size:22px}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #79879b;border-radius:8px}button{background:#173d81;color:white;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d65e00;outline-offset:3px}label{display:block;font-weight:650;margin-top:16px}input,textarea,select{background:white;color:#14213d}header,.toolbar{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.card,form,section{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #14213d08}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:10px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3ee}output,[role=status]{display:block;margin-top:18px;color:#064d37;font-weight:650}small{color:#4c5c74}[hidden]{display:none!important}a{color:#174e9b}nav{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center}dialog{max-width:min(90vw,440px);border:0;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 20px 100px #0005}dialog::backdrop{background:#14213d88}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:22px}[role=tablist]{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}[role=tab][aria-selected=true]{background:#0c563e}.error{color:#aa1818}body[data-theme=dark]{background:#111b2c;color:#eef5ff}body[data-theme=dark] section{background:#203049;color:#eef5ff;border-color:#51647f}@media(max-width:639px){.nav-toggle{display:block}#site-links{width:100%;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:20px}td,th{font-size:13px}.card,form,section{padding:16px}}@media(min-width:640px){.nav-toggle{display:none}#site-links{display:flex!important}}</style></head><body><main><h1>Design a shipping help accordion</h1><section><h2><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"a0\">Shipping</button></h2><div role=\"region\" id=\"a0\" hidden>Orders ship in two days</div></section><section><h2><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"a1\">Returns</button></h2><div role=\"region\" id=\"a1\" hidden>Returns accepted within 30 days</div></section><section><h2><button aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"a2\">Warranty</button></h2><div role=\"region\" id=\"a2\" hidden>Coverage lasts one year</div></section></main><script>document.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const open=b.getAttribute('aria-expanded')==='true';document.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(x=>{x.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false');document.getElementById(x.getAttribute('aria-controls')).hidden=true});b.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(!open));document.getElementById(b.getAttribute('aria-controls')).hidden=open;});</script></body></html>",
