    {
      "id": "reading-pagination",
      "title": "Design a paginated reading list",
      "requirements": "Build a reading list with exactly one visible list labelled Reading list, showing two entries per page in this fixed order: Aurora, Beacon, Cedar, Delta, Ember. Initially show Aurora and Beacon. A status region reads Page 1 of 3. Provide Previous and Next buttons with native disabled states at the first and last page respectively. Next shows Cedar and Delta with Page 2 of 3; Next again shows only Ember with Page 3 of 3. Previous returns to the preceding page. Native keyboard activation must work. Keep content readable and free of horizontal page overflow at desktop 1280px and mobile 390px.",
      "good_solution": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Design an order operations dashboard</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#f0f4fa;color:#14213d;font:16px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}main{max-width:1050px;margin:auto;padding:clamp(20px,5vw,64px)}h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px);line-height:1.1}h2{font-size:22px}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit;max-width:100%;padding:10px 14px;border:1px solid #79879b;border-radius:8px}button{background:#173d81;color:white;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d65e00;outline-offset:3px}label{display:block;font-weight:650;margin-top:16px}input,textarea,select{background:white;color:#14213d}header,.toolbar{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.card,form,section{background:white;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:20px 0;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #14213d08}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:15px}td,th{text-align:left;padding:10px 4px;border-bottom:1px solid #dbe3ee}output,[role=status]{display:block;margin-top:18px;color:#064d37;font-weight:650}small{color:#4c5c74}[hidden]{display:none!important}a{color:#174e9b}nav{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center}dialog{max-width:min(90vw,440px);border:0;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 20px 100px #0005}dialog::backdrop{background:#14213d88}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:22px}[role=tablist]{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}[role=tab][aria-selected=true]{background:#0c563e}.error{color:#aa1818}body[data-theme=dark]{background:#111b2c;color:#eef5ff}body[data-theme=dark] section{background:#203049;color:#eef5ff;border-color:#51647f}@media(max-width:639px){.nav-toggle{display:block}#site-links{width:100%;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:20px}td,th{font-size:13px}.card,form,section{padding:16px}}@media(min-width:640px){.nav-toggle{display:none}#site-links{display:flex!important}}</style></head><body><main><h1>Design a paginated reading list</h1><section><ul aria-label=\"Reading list\" id=\"books\"></ul><p role=\"status\" id=\"status\"></p><button id=\"prev\">Previous</button> <button id=\"next\">Next</button></section></main><script>let page=0;const titles=['Aurora','Beacon','Cedar','Delta','Ember'],prev=document.querySelector('#prev'),next=document.querySelector('#next');function render(){document.querySelector('#books').innerHTML=titles.slice(page*2,page*2+2).map(t=>'<li>'+t+'</li>').join('');document.querySelector('#status').textContent='Page '+(page+1)+' of 3';prev.disabled=page===0;next.disabled=page===2}prev.onclick=()=>{if(page>0)page--;render()};next.onclick=()=>{if(page<2)page++;render()};render();</script></body></html>",
